 the right order \u2014 but it's not just about filling orders as they come in. Preparing stock in advance based on available ingredients is equally important. Use combos and chains wisely to keep your rating climbing.\n\nAs your restaurant's reputation grows, new menu items are unlocked, making things increasingly hectic. Can you reach the coveted 5-star rating?\n\nWinner of the Grand Prize in the Indies category at the 8th CESA GAME AWARDS (2004).", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/burger-maker--1", "videos": [{"id": 160547, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "P6I7gLHgMk8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P6I7gLHgMk8", "title": "\u30d0\u30fc\u30ac\u30fc\u30e1\u30fc\u30ab\u30fc \u30c7\u30e2\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u52d5\u753b", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/P6I7gLHgMk8/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 190093, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "C5IFzuBB-Ks", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C5IFzuBB-Ks", "title": "\u843d\u3061\u7269\u30a2\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30d1\u30ba\u30eb\u300c\u30d0\u30fc\u30ac\u30fc\u30e1\u30fc\u30ab\u30fc\u300dPV", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/C5IFzuBB-Ks/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}